# 行尾策略：文本文件统一 LF 入库并保持 LF 检出，
# 避免 Windows 下 core.autocrlf 产生 "LF will be replaced by CRLF" 警告与跨平台 diff 噪音。
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理保留 CRLF（cmd 兼容性）
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件：不做任何行尾处理
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.car binary
*.jar binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.node binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.so binary
*.dylib binary
*.wasm binary
*.syso binary
*.lock binary